# 12. Indicators of Interest

During an investigation, I can record potential indicators such as:

```text
Source IP
Username
PID
Process name
Executable path
Destination IP
Destination port
Filename
File hash
Timestamp
```

These can become **Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)** when supported by evidence.

